  Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens to sen
 d everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\nhttps://www.thetrip
 lex.org/movie/wild-horse-nine\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.
 city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/wild-horse-nine
